2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.166" end="0:37.326">そ</span><span begin="0:37.326" end="0:37.516">ばに</span><span begin="0:37.516" end="0:37.766">いたい</span><span begin="0:37.766" end="0:37.986">訳</span><span begin="0:37.986" end="0:38.266">を</span><span begin="0:38.476" end="0:38.836">記</span><span begin="0:38.836" end="0:39.096">す</span><span begin="0:39.096" end="0:39.276">な</span><span begin="0:39.276" end="0:39.716">ら</span></p><p begin="0:40.013" end="0:42.993" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.013" end="0:40.223">都</span><span begin="0:40.223" end="0:40.593">合</span><span begin="0:40.593" end="0:40.813">の</span><span begin="0:40.813" end="0:41.333">いい</span><span begin="0:41.543" end="0:41.693">名</span><span begin="0:41.693" end="0:41.953">前</span><span begin="0:41.953" end="0:42.073">を</span><span begin="0:42.073" end="0:42.283">付</span><span begin="0:42.283" end="0:42.513">け</span><span begin="0:42.513" end="0:42.673">る</span><span begin="0:42.673" end="0:42.993">が</span></p><p begin="0:43.235" end="0:44.345" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.235" end="0:43.415">属</span><span begin="0:43.415" end="0:43.555">す</span><span begin="0:43.555" end="0:43.725">るこ</span><span begin="0:43.725" end="0:43.985">とない</span><span begin="0:43.985" end="0:44.345">よ</span></p><p begin="0:44.569" end="0:47.409" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.569" end="0:44.879">前</span><span begin="0:44.879" end="0:45.319">提</span><span begin="0:45.319" end="0:45.789">が</span><span begin="0:46.089" end="0:46.229">い</span><span begin="0:46.229" end="0:46.599">ない</span><span begin="0:46.599" end="0:46.869">か</span><span begin="0:46.869" end="0:47.409">ら</span></p><p begin="0:47.557" end="0:49.147" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.557" end="0:48.127">瞼</span><span begin="0:48.127" end="0:48.307">も</span><span begin="0:48.307" end="0:48.727">使</span><span begin="0:48.727" end="0:49.147">わず</span></p><p begin="0:49.141" end="0:55